## 📊 **Ledger vs Journal vs Books**

| View | Purpose | Shows |
|------|---------|-------|
| **Journal** | Complete transaction list | ALL transactions across ALL accounts |
| **Ledger** | Account-specific view | Transactions for ONE selected account |
| **Sales Book** | Sales register | List of all sales invoices |
| **Purchase Book** | Purchase register | List of all purchase invoices |

**Think of it this way**:
- **Journal** = Complete diary of all transactions
- **Ledger** = Individual account statements (like bank statement)
- **Books** = Specialized registers for specific document types

